  "description": "BIBBIA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C138 H132 Dy10 N32 O54 P4,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy10 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.800-4.168 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.86-118.18°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C138H132Dy10N32O54P4·6H2O. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
